<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>CNBC 实时热点</title><link>https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&amp;id=100727362</link><description>CNBC 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:00:01 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>警告财务“危急”后北欧大西洋航班暂停</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/norse-airline-finance-business.html</link><description>挪威大西洋航空公司暂停航班，警告其财务状况“危急”。该航空公司正在寻求短期融资并探索潜在的收购。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/norse-airline-finance-business.html'&gt;警告财务“危急”后北欧大西洋航班暂停&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Norse Atlantic flights suspended after warning finances 'critical'&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/norse-airline-finance-business.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:52:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</link><description>在华尔街隔夜从盘中低点大幅反弹后，亚太市场周四开盘走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html'&gt;由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea's Kospi leads gains as tech rebound lifts Asia markets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:49:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>SpaceX 和马斯克承诺各自向活跃的特朗普账户捐赠一股</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/spacex-musk-trump-account-stock.html</link><description>SpaceX 表示，将向每个活跃的特朗普账户捐赠一股该公司 A 级股票，首席执行官埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 也将捐出一股。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/spacex-musk-trump-account-stock.html'&gt;SpaceX 和马斯克承诺各自向活跃的特朗普账户捐赠一股&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：SpaceX, Musk pledge to donate a share each to active Trump Accounts&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/spacex-musk-trump-account-stock.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:39:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标准普尔警告英伟达信用评级可能因“上升”的管理和治理风险而被下调</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html</link><description>标准普尔全球评级表示，英伟达的信用评级可能会被下调一级，因为它指出这家芯片制造商的管理和治理风险“上升”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html'&gt;标准普尔警告英伟达信用评级可能因“上升”的管理和治理风险而被下调&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P warns Nvidia credit rating could be cut over 'rising' management and governance risk&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:19:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>挑战星链：欧洲最大卫星工厂开业，与马斯克竞争</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html</link><description>这座占地2万平方米的巨型工厂每年将能够生产多达500颗卫星，使其成为世界第三大卫星生产基地。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html'&gt;挑战星链：欧洲最大卫星工厂开业，与马斯克竞争&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Taking on Starlink: Europe’s largest satellite factory opens in push to rival Musk&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:45:05 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>